{"id":"7d705cc83554428abee30fb7c22fdb53ffa3d153","axis":"silent","repo":"nestjs/nest","sha":"7d705cc83554428abee30fb7c22fdb53ffa3d153","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"integration/websockets/e2e/connection-during-startup.spec.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,189 @@","+import {","+  INestApplicationContext,","+  Inject,","+  Injectable,","+  OnApplicationBootstrap,","+  OnModuleInit,","+} from '@nestjs/common';","+import { CustomTransportStrategy, Server } from '@nestjs/microservices';","+import { WsAdapter } from '@nestjs/platform-ws';","+import { Test } from '@nestjs/testing';","+import { SubscribeMessage, WebSocketGateway } from '@nestjs/websockets';","+import { io, Socket } from 'socket.io-client';","+import WebSocket from 'ws';","+","+const GATEWAY_PORT = 8095;","+","+class NoopTransport extends Server implements CustomTransportStrategy {","+  listen(callback: () => void) {","+    callback();","+  }","+  close() {}","+  on() {}","+  unwrap<T>(): T {","+    return null as T;","+  }","+}","+","+let hooksCanComplete: Promise<void>;","+","+@Injectable()","+class StartupService implements OnModuleInit, OnApplicationBootstrap {","+  state = 'constructed';","+  calls: string[] = [];","+","+  async onModuleInit() {","+    await hooksCanComplete;","+    this.state = 'initialized';","+  }","+","+  async onApplicationBootstrap() {","+    // Long enough for a client that keeps reconnecting to try while it runs","+    await new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, 100));","+    this.state = 'bootstrapped';","+  }","+}","+","+@WebSocketGateway(GATEWAY_PORT)","+class OwnPortGateway {","+  constructor(","+    @Inject(StartupService) private readonly startup: StartupService,","+  ) {}","+","+  handleConnection() {","+    this.startup.calls.push(`connection: ${this.startup.state}`);","+  }","+","+  handleDisconnect() {","+    this.startup.calls.push(`disconnection: ${this.startup.state}`);","+  }","+","+  @SubscribeMessage('state')","+  getState() {","+    this.startup.calls.push(`message: ${this.startup.state}`);","+    return { event: 'state', data: this.startup.state };","+  }","+}","+","+describe('WebSocketGateway on its own port - clients connecting during startup', () => {","+  let app: INestApplicationContext;","+  let started: Promise<unknown>;","+  let completeHooks: () => void;","+  let ws: WebSocket | undefined;","+  let socket: Socket | undefined;","+","+  beforeEach(() => {","+    hooksCanComplete = new Promise(resolve => (completeHooks = resolve));","+  });","+","+  afterEach(async () => {","+    ws?.terminate();","+    ws = undefined;","+    socket?.disconnect();","+    socket = undefined;","+    completeHooks();","+    await started;","+    await app.close();","+  });","+","+  // Each one starts without being waited for: its \"onModuleInit()\" hook stays","+  // pending until \"completeHooks()\" is called.","+  const targets = {","+    application: async (useWsAdapter: boolean) => {","+      const testingModule = await Test.createTestingModule({","+        providers: [StartupService, OwnPortGateway],","+      }).compile();","+      const nestApp = testingModule.createNestApplication({ logger: false });","+      useWsAdapter && nestApp.useWebSocketAdapter(new WsAdapter(nestApp));","+      app = nestApp;","+      started = nestApp.init();","+    },","+    microservice: async (useWsAdapter: boolean) => {","+      const testingModule = await Test.createTestingModule({","+        providers: [StartupService, OwnPortGateway],","+      }).compile();","+      const microservice = testingModule.createNestMicroservice({","+        strategy: new NoopTransport(),","+        logger: false,","+      });","+      useWsAdapter && microservice.useWebSocketAdapter(new WsAdapter());","+      app = microservice;","+      started = microservice.listen();","+    },","+  };","+","+  /**","+   * Connects as soon as the port of the gateway is open, sends a message and","+   * resolves with the reply, or with `undefined` if the connection is closed","+   * without one.","+   */","+  async function askForState(): Promise<string | undefined> {","+    for (;;) {","+      const client = new WebSocket(`ws://localhost:${GATEWAY_PORT}`);","+      ws = client;","+      const isOpen = await new Promise<boolean>(resolve => {","+        client.once('open', () => resolve(true));","+        client.once('error', () => resolve(false));","+      });","+      if (isOpen) {","+        break;","+      }","+      await new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, 10));","+    }","+    const client = ws!;","+    const reply = new Promise<string | undefined>(resolve => {","+      client.once('message', data => resolve(JSON.parse(data.toString()).data));","+      client.once('close', () => resolve(undefined));","+    });","+    client.send(JSON.stringify({ event: 'state' }));","+    return reply;","+  }","+","+  describe.each(['application', 'microservice'] as const)('%s', target => {","+    it('should turn away a client (ws) until the lifecycle hooks have completed', async () => {","+      await targets[target](true);","+","+      expect(await askForState()).toBeUndefined();","+      expect(app.get(StartupService).calls).toEqual([]);","+","+      completeHooks();","+      await started;","+","+      expect(await askForState()).toBe('bootstrapped');","+      expect(app.get(StartupService).calls).toEqual([","+        'connection: bootstrapped',","+        'message: bootstrapped',","+      ]);","+    });","+","+    it('should serve a client (socket.io) once it reconnects after the lifecycle hooks have completed', async () => {","+      await targets[target](false);","+","+      const client = io(`http://localhost:${GATEWAY_PORT}`, {","+        transports: ['websocket'],","+        forceNew: true,","+        reconnectionDelay: 50,","+        reconnectionDelayMax: 50,","+      });","+      socket = client;","+      client.on('connect', () => client.emit('state'));","+      const state = new Promise<string>(resolve => client.on('state', resolve));","+","+      const disconnectReason = new Promise<string>(resolve =>","+        client.once('disconnect', resolve),","+      );","+      expect(await Promise.race([disconnectReason, state])).toBe(","+        'transport close',","+      );","+      expect(app.get(StartupService).calls).toEqual([]);","+","+      completeHooks();","+","+      expect(await state).toBe('bootstrapped');","+      expect(app.get(StartupService).calls).toEqual([","+        'connection: bootstrapped',","+        'message: bootstrapped',","+      ]);","+    });","+  });","+});"],"additions":189,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/common/interfaces/websockets/web-socket-adapter.interface.ts","lines":["@@ -20,6 +20,13 @@ export interface WebSocketAdapter<","   create(port: number, options?: TOptions): TServer;","   bindClientConnect(server: TServer, callback: Function): any;","   bindClientDisconnect?(client: TClient, callback: Function): any;","+  /**","+   * Drops a client that connected while the lifecycle hooks of the application","+   * (\"onModuleInit\", \"onApplicationBootstrap\") were still running. Nothing was","+   * bound to it, so that it is not served by providers that are not","+   * initialized yet.","+   */","+  closeClient?(client: TClient): any;","   bindMessageHandlers(","     client: TClient,","     handlers: WsMessageHandler[],"],"additions":7,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/core/nest-application.ts","lines":["@@ -176,6 +176,11 @@ export class NestApplication","     if (!this.socketModule) {","       return;","     }","+    // A gateway with its own port is listening as soon as it is registered,","+    // which is before the lifecycle hooks have run. Its clients are turned","+    // away until \"init()\" lets them in.","+    // Optional call, as an older \"@nestjs/websockets\" may not implement it","+    this.socketModule.rejectClients?.();","     await this.socketModule.register(","       this.container,","       this.config,","@@ -210,6 +215,7